  {"id": "c3", "verdict": "keep", "level": "E2", "same_as": "", "reason": "A's 'Hello ?' in turn 1 is a response to someone initiating contact (e.g., calling or approaching). The question mark and greeting format strongly presuppose B initiated.", "counterexample": ""},
  {"id": "c4", "verdict": "keep", "level": "E2", "same_as": "", "reason": "A's 'Nothing. Just watching TV.' in turn 3 is a direct response to a question about what A is doing, presupposing B asked this.", "counterexample": ""},
  {"id": "c5", "verdict": "duplicate", "level": "E2", "same_as": "c1", "reason": "c1 and c5 both refer to B proposing a meeting/activity together. 'Proposed to meet up' and 'proposed doing an activity together' are equivalent at this granularity.", "counterexample": ""},
